<script setup lang="ts">import{X}from'@lucide/vue';import type{RoleTemplate}from'@/types/organization';defineProps<{open:boolean;form:Record<string,any>;templates:RoleTemplate[];saving:boolean;errorMessage:string}>();defineEmits<{close:[];save:[]}>()</script>
<template><div v-if="open" class="drawer-backdrop-v2"><aside class="form-drawer-v2 account-drawer"><header class="drawer-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">Internal member</span><h2>{{form.id?'编辑内部成员':'新增内部成员'}}</h2></div><button class="icon-button" @click="$emit('close')"><X :size="18"/></button></header><div class="drawer-body"><section class="form-section"><div class="section-heading"><span>1</span><div><h3>登录身份</h3><p>内部成员共享当前组织数据，不创建新的代理主体。</p></div></div><div class="form-grid-v2"><label><span>登录账号</span><input v-model.trim="form.username" :disabled="Boolean(form.id)"/></label><label><span>显示名称</span><input v-model.trim="form.displayName"/></label></div><label><span>{{form.id?'重置密码（留空不修改）':'初始密码'}}</span><input v-model="form.password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password"/></label></section><section class="form-section"><div class="section-heading"><span>2</span><div><h3>岗位与状态</h3><p>岗位决定操作权限；数据范围和组织能力会继续收缩最终权限。</p></div></div><label><span>岗位模板</span><select v-model="form.roleTemplateId"><option v-for="item in templates.filter(x=>x.status==='enabled')" :key="item.id" :value="item.id">{{item.name}}{{item.systemBuiltin?' · 系统':''}}</option></select></label><label><span>账号状态</span><select v-model="form.status"><option value="enabled">启用</option><option value="disabled">停用</option></select></label></section><p v-if="errorMessage" class="drawer-error">{{errorMessage}}</p></div><footer class="drawer-footer"><button class="primary-button" :disabled="saving" @click="$emit('save')">{{saving?'保存中…':'保存内部成员'}}</button></footer></aside></div></template>
